---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About SoloStack"
  description="Why SoloStack exists and how we choose what to review."
>
  <h1>About SoloStack</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    SoloStack exists because running a one-person (or two-person) consulting or service business means
    you're also the ops team, the marketer, and the IT department. We do the tool research so you don't have to.
  </p>
  <h2>How we pick what to cover</h2>
  <p>
    We prioritize tools that solve a real, recurring problem for independent consultants: proposals and
    contracts, scheduling, client communication, automation between apps, note-taking, and getting found
    online. We test free tiers and trials ourselves before writing about a tool, and we update articles
    when pricing or features change materially.
  </p>
  <h2>How we make money</h2>
  <p>
    SoloStack is reader-supported. Some of the tools we recommend pay us a commission if you sign up
    through our links — this never changes the price you pay, and it never determines whether a tool
    gets a positive review. Full detail in our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions, corrections, or a tool you think we should cover: <a href="mailto:hello@solostack.io">hello@solostack.io</a></p>
</BaseLayout>
